{"seq":1,"slug":"onward-transfer-control","title":"再传输（onward）控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/transfer-enforce-audit/onward-transfer-control","wordCount":2034,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"再传输-onward-控制\">再传输（onward）控制</h1><p>合同签完，数据到了接收方手里，风险并没有停下——它只是换了个位置。一家美国的数据处理商会把一部分分析外包给印度的团队，一家新加坡的客服系统会把工单同步给菲律宾的供应商。每一次这样的转发都是一次新的跨境传输，而出口方对它既没有技术可见性，也没有直接的控制手段。更麻烦的是法律上这条链条是<strong>连坐</strong>的：GDPR 第 44 条明确本章各项条件「包括从第三国或国际组织向另一第三国或另一国际组织的再传输」都必须被遵守，保护水平在整条链上不得被削弱（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-44-gdpr/\">Article 44 GDPR</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-再传输是出口方责任的延长线\">核心概念：再传输是出口方责任的延长线</h2><p>把再传输纳入管理的前提是承认一个不舒服的事实：<strong>出口方对接收方的下游负有责任，但不掌握下游的技术事实</strong>。这种信息不对称决定了两件事必须同时做——合同层面把义务传递下去，技术层面建立可验证的传递证据。只做前者会得到一份纸面完整的合同链和完全失控的实际数据流；只做后者会得到一个能看见但无约束力的监控面板。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[出口方&lt;br/&gt;欧盟主体] --&gt;|模块二 SCC| I1[接收方&lt;br/&gt;美国处理者]&#10;  I1 --&gt;|再传输 1| I2[分包商&lt;br/&gt;印度]&#10;  I2 --&gt;|再传输 2| I3[子分包商&lt;br/&gt;菲律宾]&#10;  E -.合同义务传递.-&gt; I1&#10;  I1 -.合同义务传递.-&gt; I2&#10;  I2 -.合同义务传递.-&gt; I3&#10;  E -.可验证披露.-&gt; R[再传输登记册]&#10;  I1 --&gt; R&#10;  I2 --&gt; R\">graph TD\n  E[出口方&lt;br/&gt;欧盟主体] --&gt;|模块二 SCC| I1[接收方&lt;br/&gt;美国处理者]\n  I1 --&gt;|再传输 1| I2[分包商&lt;br/&gt;印度]\n  I2 --&gt;|再传输 2| I3[子分包商&lt;br/&gt;菲律宾]\n  E -.合同义务传递.-&gt; I1\n  I1 -.合同义务传递.-&gt; I2\n  I2 -.合同义务传递.-&gt; I3\n  E -.可验证披露.-&gt; R[再传输登记册]\n  I1 --&gt; R\n  I2 --&gt; R</pre><p>链上每一跳都必须有机制覆盖。第 46(2) 条把「经批准的认证机制」与「经批准的行为准则」列为可行工具，但都要求第三国接收方做出「有约束力和可执行的承诺」以适用相应保障，包括数据主体权利（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-46-gdpr/\">Article 46 GDPR</a>）。对再传输而言，这意味着最经济的设计通常是<strong>让链条上每一跳都走同一套工具</strong>（同一份 SCC 模块三、或同一个 BCR 覆盖范围内），而不是每跳换一种机制——混用会让责任划分在出问题时不清晰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三级控制强度与选择依据\">三级控制强度与选择依据</h2><h3 id=\"三级强度与反对窗口\">三级强度与反对窗口</h3><p>再传输控制有三个强度层级，选择依据是数据的分类与接收方的可替代性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>控制方式</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>技术验证手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>禁止</td>\n<td>合同禁止任何再传输</td>\n<td>重要数据、敏感个人信息且无必要下游</td>\n<td>出网监控 + 合同违约条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事前书面批准</td>\n<td>每次新增下游需出口方书面同意</td>\n<td>敏感个人信息、外部处理者</td>\n<td>批准记录 + 分包商登记册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般性授权 + 通知</td>\n<td>允许同类下游，新增时通知并给予反对机会</td>\n<td>普通个人数据</td>\n<td>通知记录 + 反对窗口记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行与 GDPR 对分包的一般要求同源：处理者未经控制者「事前特定或一般书面授权」不得再委托另一处理者；若授权是一般性的，处理者必须通知拟新增或替换的分包商，使控制者有机会「反对此类变更」（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-28-gdpr/\">Article 28 GDPR</a>）。注意「有机会反对」需要一个<strong>反对窗口</strong>——如果通知当天生效，这个权利就是空的。因此通知机制必须带一个明确的等待期，且等待期内下游不得开始处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE onward_transfer_registry (&#10;  onward_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  parent_entity   BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES importer_entity(entity_id),&#10;  downstream_entity BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES importer_entity(entity_id),&#10;  data_path       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  control_mode    TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (control_mode IN&#10;                    (&#39;forbidden&#39;,&#39;prior_written&#39;,&#39;general_notice&#39;)),&#10;  notified_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  objection_window_ends TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  approved_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  approval_ref    TEXT,&#10;  mechanism       TEXT NOT NULL,          -- scc_m3 | bcr_covered | certification&#10;  active_from     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  active_to       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  CHECK (control_mode &lt;&gt; &#39;general_notice&#39;&#10;         OR objection_window_ends &gt; notified_at),&#10;  CHECK (control_mode &lt;&gt; &#39;prior_written&#39; OR approved_at IS NOT NULL)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onward_transfer_registry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onward_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_entity   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_entity(entity_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  downstream_entity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_entity(entity_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data_path       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  control_mode    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (control_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forbidden'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prior_written'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'general_notice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  notified_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  objection_window_ends </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approved_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approval_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mechanism       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- scc_m3 | bcr_covered | certification</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  active_from     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  active_to       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (control_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'general_notice'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> objection_window_ends </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notified_at),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (control_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'prior_written'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approved_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两条 <code>CHECK</code> 把「反对窗口必须为正」与「事前批准必须有批准记录」写成不变量。第二条约束尤其重要：<code>active_from &gt;= approved_at</code> 的关系本身就隐含了「先批准、后处理」的顺序要求，若允许新下游先上线再补批准，事前批准就退化成了一般性通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术层面的传递证据\">技术层面的传递证据</h2><h3 id=\"四种可验证信号\">四种可验证信号</h3><p>合同义务必须落到可观测的信号上，否则无法验证。（下图给出四类信号。）</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[再传输可验证信号] --&gt; S1[分包商登记册&lt;br/&gt;接收方定期申报下游清单]&#10;  A --&gt; S2[出网异常检测&lt;br/&gt;接收方所在国流向第四国的新增连接]&#10;  A --&gt; S3[数据水印/指纹&lt;br/&gt;抽查下游数据中是否含标记]&#10;  A --&gt; S4[审计权行使&lt;br/&gt;现场或远程审计记录]&#10;  S1 --&gt; V[再传输登记册核验]&#10;  S2 --&gt; V&#10;  S3 --&gt; V&#10;  S4 --&gt; V\">graph LR\n  A[再传输可验证信号] --&gt; S1[分包商登记册&lt;br/&gt;接收方定期申报下游清单]\n  A --&gt; S2[出网异常检测&lt;br/&gt;接收方所在国流向第四国的新增连接]\n  A --&gt; S3[数据水印/指纹&lt;br/&gt;抽查下游数据中是否含标记]\n  A --&gt; S4[审计权行使&lt;br/&gt;现场或远程审计记录]\n  S1 --&gt; V[再传输登记册核验]\n  S2 --&gt; V\n  S3 --&gt; V\n  S4 --&gt; V</pre><p>第一类<strong>分包商登记册</strong>是最常用的：要求接收方在变更下游清单时主动申报，并在年度审计时核对。它的弱点是依赖对方申报的诚实性，因此必须有交叉验证。第二类<strong>出网异常检测</strong>的可行方式是在数据中嵌入<strong>不可感知但可检出的标记</strong>，然后用外部可见的信号（下游服务公开的端点区域）做匹配。第三类<strong>数据指纹</strong>是抽查手段：在传出的数据集中植入少量唯一标记记录，若日后在某个未申报的下游出现这些标记，就证明了未申报的再传输。这类手段的法律可行性需要逐法域确认，技术上它是少数能真正发现「隐瞒的再传输」的方法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 未申报再传输的检测: 指纹记录在非登记下游出现&#10;WITH fingerprint_hits AS (&#10;  SELECT f.fingerprint_id, f.origin_path, o.observed_entity,&#10;         o.observed_at&#10;  FROM data_fingerprint f&#10;  JOIN downstream_observation o ON o.fingerprint_id = f.fingerprint_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT h.fingerprint_id, h.origin_path, h.observed_entity, h.observed_at&#10;FROM fingerprint_hits h&#10;LEFT JOIN onward_transfer_registry r&#10;  ON r.parent_entity = h.origin_path_owner&#10; AND r.downstream_entity = h.observed_entity&#10;WHERE r.onward_id IS NULL&#10;  AND h.origin_path = r.data_path IS NOT TRUE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 未申报再传输的检测: 指纹记录在非登记下游出现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fingerprint_hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fingerprint_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">origin_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">observed_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">observed_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_fingerprint f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> downstream_observation o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fingerprint_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fingerprint_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fingerprint_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">origin_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">observed_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">observed_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fingerprint_hits h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onward_transfer_registry r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">origin_path_owner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">downstream_entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">observed_entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">onward_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">origin_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"拒绝处理的请求权与第-48-条\">拒绝处理的请求权与第 48 条</h3><h3 id=\"第-48-条与拒绝处理的请求权\">第 48 条与拒绝处理的请求权</h3><p>再传输链条上还有一处必须处理的法律风险：第三国法院或监管机构直接向接收方发出的数据提供命令。GDPR 第 48 条专门针对这种情形，明确第三国法院或行政机构的判决与决定，若要求控制者或处理者传输或披露个人数据，只有在<strong>基于国际协定</strong>（如司法协助条约）的前提下才可被承认或执行（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/chapter-5/\">Chapter V, Article 48</a>）。工程含义是：接收方收到的这类命令不能自动转化为「我们不得不提供」的抗辩，合同必须要求接收方在收到此类请求时<strong>通知出口方并评估其法律依据</strong>，且在无有效国际协定依据时提出异议。</p>\n<p>这与 SCC 里的异议义务是同一件事的两面：一条约束接收方在收到请求时的行为，一条限定了请求本身的可执行范围。把「收到政府请求」建成一个<strong>必须上报的事件类型</strong>，纳入 <a href=\"outbound-request-log-attest\">出境请求留痕与证据留存</a> 的事件流，可以让出口方在第一时间获知，从而有时间采取法律行动而不是事后得知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"链路可视性-从合同链到实体图\">链路可视性：从合同链到实体图</h2><p>再传输管理的最后一块是让整条链条可见。合同链是文书的串联，而实体图是<strong>主体之间的关系</strong>；两者需要互相映射，因为审计问的是「这个数据现在在哪些实体手里」，而合同给的是「我们和谁签了什么」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 从出口方出发展开全部下游实体(递归)&#10;WITH RECURSIVE chain AS (&#10;  SELECT r.parent_entity, r.downstream_entity, r.data_path,&#10;         r.mechanism, 1 AS depth,&#10;         ARRAY[r.parent_entity] AS visited&#10;  FROM onward_transfer_registry r&#10;  WHERE r.parent_entity = $exporter_entity AND r.active_to IS NULL&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT r.parent_entity, r.downstream_entity, r.data_path,&#10;         r.mechanism, c.depth + 1, c.visited || r.downstream_entity&#10;  FROM onward_transfer_registry r&#10;  JOIN chain c ON r.parent_entity = c.downstream_entity&#10;  WHERE r.active_to IS NULL&#10;    AND NOT r.downstream_entity = ANY(c.visited)   -- 防环&#10;)&#10;SELECT depth, parent_entity, downstream_entity, data_path, mechanism&#10;FROM chain ORDER BY depth, downstream_entity;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 从出口方出发展开全部下游实体(递归)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">downstream_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[r.parent_entity] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> visited</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onward_transfer_registry r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $exporter_entity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">downstream_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">visited</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">downstream_entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onward_transfer_registry r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chain c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">downstream_entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">downstream_entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">visited</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 防环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth, parent_entity, downstream_entity, data_path, mechanism</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth, downstream_entity;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>visited</code> 数组防环不是可选项：集团内部的实体图经常存在交叉持股或互为供应商的情况，不做防环的递归查询会在生产库里挂死。展开结果的价值在于回答两个审计问题——<strong>哪些实体拿到了哪条链路的数据</strong>，以及<strong>哪一跳的机制与上一跳不匹配</strong>（例如上一跳是模块二处理者关系，下一跳却按模块一控制者关系签）。这里用到的 <code>mechanism</code> 与模块语义来自 <a href=\"../transfer-mechanism-config/scc-bcr-adequacy-eu\">欧盟 SCC/BCR/充分性认定</a>：模块三（处理者到处理者）正是为再传输场景准备的，因此链条中间的跳通常应当引用模块三而不是模块二。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>第 44 条把再传输纳入同一套条件，链条上<strong>每一跳都必须有机制覆盖</strong>，保护水平在整条链上不得被削弱。</li>\n<li>三级控制强度按数据分类与下游可替代性选择；「一般性授权」必须带<strong>实质性反对窗口</strong>，否则第 28 条的反对权形同虚设。</li>\n<li>合同义务要落到四类可验证信号：分包商登记册、出网异常检测、数据指纹抽查、审计权行使；<strong>数据指纹</strong>是少数能发现隐瞒性再传输的手段。</li>\n<li>第 48 条限定第三国命令仅在<strong>有国际协定依据</strong>时才可被承认或执行；「收到政府请求」应当成为必须上报的事件类型。</li>\n<li>链路可视性靠实体图递归展开，必须<strong>防环</strong>；展开结果可直接暴露机制不匹配的跳。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"outbound-request-log-attest\">出境请求留痕与证据留存</a> 展开每一次出境动作的记录设计。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"再传输（onward）控制","id":"再传输-onward-控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：再传输是出口方责任的延长线","id":"核心概念-再传输是出口方责任的延长线"},{"level":2,"text":"三级控制强度与选择依据","id":"三级控制强度与选择依据"},{"level":3,"text":"三级强度与反对窗口","id":"三级强度与反对窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"技术层面的传递证据","id":"技术层面的传递证据"},{"level":3,"text":"四种可验证信号","id":"四种可验证信号"},{"level":3,"text":"拒绝处理的请求权与第 48 条","id":"拒绝处理的请求权与第-48-条"},{"level":3,"text":"第 48 条与拒绝处理的请求权","id":"第-48-条与拒绝处理的请求权"},{"level":2,"text":"链路可视性：从合同链到实体图","id":"链路可视性-从合同链到实体图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"传输合同审批与签署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/tia-dpia-workflow/transfer-contract-approval"},"next":{"title":"出境请求留痕与证据留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/transfer-enforce-audit/outbound-request-log-attest"}}